  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Three scripts, each with one job. The field of view is an Area Trigger: its On Enter and On Exit start and stop the filling of AlarmMeter. GameManager asks AlarmMeter for the alarm, and when it is full fires On Lose, which turns Lamp 5 red. Two connections are events; one is a method call.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Lamp 5 turns red. Which script's event switched it on: AreaTrigger, AlarmMeter or GameManager?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play, select Alarm 5 and watch currentAlarm in Code Watch.\n2. Select Sight 5 and Game Manager 5, and read their events.\n3. Optional: Tools \u203A Mavrodiev \u203A C# Playground \u203A Show Wires."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6055507529455485361, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
