  m_text: 'Visitor 4 carries three small scripts. Health keeps the value. Damager takes 20 when the visitor enters Fire 4. Healer gives back 8 every second. Damager and Healer each hold the Health on the same object. One large script could do all three; three small ones can each be removed, or reused on another object.


    <b>Predict:</b> In Play mode you untick Healer on Visitor 4. What happens to its health from then on?


    <b>Try:</b>

    1. Press Play, select Visitor 4, and find Health, Damager and Healer.

    2. Watch Current Health in the Inspector over a few passes.

    3. Untick Healer, and watch again.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6055507529455485361, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
