      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "class ShrinkAction : BaseAction means ShrinkAction is built on BaseAction: it gets objectToResize and ResetSize without writing them again, and adds Shrink. GrowAction does the same and adds Grow. This is inheritance. It suits scripts that share the same variables and methods; Unity projects more often combine small scripts, as at stand 4.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Block 6 carries ShrinkAction and GrowAction. How many Object To Resize slots does it show in the Inspector?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select Block 6 and read its two components.\n2. Press Play. Right-click ShrinkAction \u203A Shrink, twice.\n3. Right-click GrowAction \u203A Reset Size."
