      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>Exercise \xB7 Write</b>\n\n<b>Task:</b>\n1. Add an Area Trigger to Coin Zone E4. From ActionTemplate.cs, write Wallet: an action AddCoin that On Enter calls.\n2. Give Wallet a public method GetCoins that returns the number of coins.\n3. Write a script that asks the Wallet, and switches Lamp E4 on at 3 coins."
