      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "One Damager script, connected in two ways. Fire 3A: its Target Health slot holds the Health of Visitor 3A, and the code calls targetHealth.TakeDamage. Fire 3B: Target Health is empty, and its On Hit lists Visitor 3B \u203A Health.TakeDamage, 10. The first way names Health in the code; the second is set in the Inspector.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Both visitors start with 100 health and walk the same path. After the first pass, which one has less health?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play and watch the two health bars.\n2. Select Fire 3A, then Fire 3B: compare Target Health and On Hit.\n3. Optional: Tools \u203A Mavrodiev \u203A C# Playground \u203A Show Wires."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
